# Skillfile — agent skills installed via `bunx skills add`
# One install reference per line (name, package, or URL).
# Lines starting with # are comments, blank lines are ignored.
#
# Install all:  skills restore
# Dump current: skills dump
#
# ⚠️  Verify these entries match the exact reference you used to install.
#     Some skills may need a full package name or URL instead of just the name.
#     If a single install pulled in sub-skills, keep only the top-level
#     entry here.
#
#     Skills provided by a Claude Code plugin (Pluginfile) don't belong
#     here — they aren't `bunx skills add` installs and won't resolve.
#
#     Custom skills whose content is committed under .agents/skills/<name>
#     with a tracked symlink in .claude/skills/ (e.g. caffeinate, fellow,
#     nlm-skill, find-docs) don't belong here either — they arrive with the
#     repo checkout, not via `bunx skills add`.
#
#     Skills that live in a PRIVATE repo go in Skillfile.private (tracked by
#     dotfiles-private), not here — same split as Pluginfile/Pluginfile.private.
#     setup.sh reads both.

